MODEL WEIGHTS LICENSE
=====================

This file covers the trained model weights that Forma offers in its Model list
and downloads onto your computer when you pick one — the nnU-Net checkpoint
files (`*.pth`) and the accompanying plan, dataset and manifest files of each
model package, such as Dataset226 neuronal morphology Global V6.

It does NOT cover the application itself, which is licensed separately under
the GNU General Public License v3.0 — see the `LICENSE` file.


